[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977483194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116457#issuecomment-3977483194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116457","id":3977483194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tE5O6","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T17:42:18Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T17:46:04Z","body":"I saw differences in the modern theme although I'm unsure what's different in the classic theme. If changes are to be applied, and if they are related to animation, I believe changes would also be needed in the AnimationLibraryEditor.\r\n\r\nIt seems you might be picking up things that were forgotten to be applied when the scroll hint was implemented previously. I think it would be better to have a single PR that finds and applies all necessary changes in other places, not just for animations, in case such places exist.\r\n\r\nAs I mentioned above, I won't approve this immediately because I think it need consistency regarding Animation, at least concerning the AnimationLibraryManager, but I don't see any problem with merging this itself.\r\n\r\nIf you are going to create a comprehensive PR that applies to areas other than Animation, it would be good to have someone very familiar with the modern theme review it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977483194/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977984331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116457#issuecomment-3977984331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116457","id":3977984331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tGzlL","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T21:44:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T21:45:35Z","body":"> I saw differences in the modern theme although I'm unsure what's different in the classic theme.\r\n\r\nScroll hints are only available for the modern theme.\r\n\r\n> If changes are to be applied, and if they are related to animation, I believe changes would also be needed in the AnimationLibraryEditor.\r\n\r\nThere's already a PR for that: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115038\r\n\r\n> It seems you might be picking up things that were forgotten to be applied when the scroll hint was implemented previously. I think it would be better to have a single PR that finds and applies all necessary changes in other places, not just for animations, in case such places exist.\r\n\r\nThose are the only places left that I can think of that need hints.\r\n\r\nI can unify the two PRs if you want, but I don't see what much this achieves besides giving me more work for little to no gain. And I'm already busy as is with the `GridMap` tasks.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977984331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4000124082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116457#issuecomment-4000124082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116457","id":4000124082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ubQyy","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repit